-- Exact echo accounting for synthetic F presses (measured live: every virtual
-- press echoes exactly once into InputBegan/InputEnded, and IsKeyDown tracks
-- the virtual state, so timestamps + IsKeyDown polling cannot be trusted).
-- Each script press expects exactly one echo; a genuine finger event is only
